{"name": "Echoes of the Sun", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Echoes of the Sun is a first-person puzzle-platformer adventure game in a fantasy setting where you play as a brave girl with telekinesis, who tries to reach her parents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Restore the environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extinguish fires, rebuild surroundings, and bring nature around you back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/2b3556b4a771391d9caf4e0866aca185.poster.avif?t=1749477267\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/2b3556b4a771391d9caf4e0866aca185.webm?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/2b3556b4a771391d9caf4e0866aca185.mp4?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use Telekinesis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate objects, interact with mechanisms, and overcome obstacles. <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/326d0930c8689955ccba4ea07f2be7d5.poster.avif?t=1749477267\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/326d0930c8689955ccba4ea07f2be7d5.webm?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/326d0930c8689955ccba4ea07f2be7d5.mp4?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Solar Magic Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use various magical devices to bend and combine energy beams, activating solar magic and gradually restoring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/5390180a64b7c0a1150b9fd6a9bb7d7d.poster.avif?t=1749477267\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/5390180a64b7c0a1150b9fd6a9bb7d7d.webm?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/5390180a64b7c0a1150b9fd6a9bb7d7d.mp4?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore an Island Full of Ghosts and Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through Zoria, you'll encounter touching and chilling stories of ghosts filled with secrets and heartfelt confessions. Uncover the true story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/322e78e4118386723c46491798f2ab59.poster.avif?t=1749477267\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/322e78e4118386723c46491798f2ab59.webm?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/extras/322e78e4118386723c46491798f2ab59.mp4?t=1749477267\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restoring the world is no easy task, but those who are brave and pure of heart will surely succeed. Let\u2019s embark on this challenging journey with Mia and make Zoria  a brighter place!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "This is a moving puzzle adventure story about a teenage girl, Mia, who witnessed the tragic fall of her homeland and the explosion of the Sun. A heavy burden fell on her fragile shoulders - she must restore light to the land and peace in her heart. Will she succeed?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863040/856e3dd72a1e712bc7d445f316d583159551a5e4/header.jpg?t=1749477267", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle Platformer", "Adventure", "First-Person", "Puzzle", "Mystery", "Atmospheric"], "developers": "Outer Realms", "publishers": "Outer Realms", "release_date": "May 26, 2025", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "2863040", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1k8M1n5pOqE", "first_seen": 1740096000.0, "review_rank": 1794}